      "sourceSha256": "04f3ec47a49c119d0f65c1963dc17ec7b0f146500a23ba9cb70e0295a998ab17",
      "patch": "scripts/openui-each-counter.mjs",
      "patchSha256": "b87765db32c1a1cac1c32c635fa19a104de0af2ff765277fa5dcb364963a008d",
      "description": "Applied to the bundled copy only, never to node_modules: the lazy @Each evaluation calls a counter that src/vendor/intelligent/client/openui-budget.ts installs, with each list length and the evaluation context, so the block whose Renderer evaluates the loop is charged and an over-budget loop is abandoned. The build fails when the evaluator no longer matches."
    }
  ],
